    <!-- 2048: screen texts -->
    <string name="g2048_help_title">How to Play 2048</string>
    <string name="g2048_help_text">Swipe the board, press the arrow buttons or use the arrow keys to slide every tile as far as it will go. When two tiles with the same number collide they merge into one tile with double the value. A tile made by a merge cannot merge again in the same move.\n\nAfter every move that changes the board, a new tile appears: usually a 2, sometimes a 4. Your score is the total of every tile you make by merging.\n\nMake the %1$d tile to win, then keep going for a higher score if you like. The game ends when the board is full and no move is left.\n\nUndo takes back a move and Hint suggests one, but a game that used either is assisted and cannot set a best score.</string>

